{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_Logo_Titre.png?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_Titres_EN_1.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends and dive into <i>Abyssus</i>' <strong>fast-paced multiplayer shooting action</strong>. Fight through gorgeous hand-crafted levels in a roguelite adventure that will put your tactical skills to the ultimate test. Wield powerful brine-powered weapons and refit them with ancient technologies to gain an edge over your foes. Obtain divine blessings to enhance your firepower with elemental and mystic effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world powered by brine, a rare and powerful substance only found in the deepest fathoms of the sea, your team of daring brinepunk explorers is recruited to claim a massive deposit located beneath the ruins of an ancient civilization. However, your mission becomes a frantic battle for survival when the sunken kingdom\u2019s corrupted inhabitants rise against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One Action-Packed Battleground!</strong><br>Experience the adrenaline rush with the Abandoned Temple, the first region of the full game to experience <i>Abyssus</i>\u2019 nail-biting game flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Taste of Firepower!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engine Rifle \u2013 To start with a classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shotgun \u2013 Good job killing that Elite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turret \u2013 If you can beat the final challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revolver \u2013 Really? Where is it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Mods Galore!</strong><br>Primary fire, secondary fire... choose wisely if you want to survive in the Abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divine Power at Your Fingertips!</strong><br>All Gods are available - choose your patron, and fire at will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Tree Preview!</strong><br>Discover all the perks and power-ups available in the full game, and unlock the first two tiers to boost your playstyle in this Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize Your Look!</strong><br>Suit up with two badass suits, mix and match helmets, and tweak your colors for that perfect brinepunk style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you survive to see the surface again, or will the abyss claim your life?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_PlayTheDemo_Steam_616x66.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437340?t=1744293387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/e2b5615e6a02f5cdecab23da9ae11b5cd9042162/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744293387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/0ef7857066c1d502b04ee8b63fc04a3b77b601dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744293387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/0ef7857066c1d502b04ee8b63fc04a3b77b601dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744293387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Abyssus is a stylized FPS with violent imagery."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_Logo_Titre.png?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_Titres_EN_1.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends and dive into <i>Abyssus</i>' <strong>fast-paced multiplayer shooting action</strong>. Fight through gorgeous hand-crafted levels in a roguelite adventure that will put your tactical skills to the ultimate test. Wield powerful brine-powered weapons and refit them with ancient technologies to gain an edge over your foes. Obtain divine blessings to enhance your firepower with elemental and mystic effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world powered by brine, a rare and powerful substance only found in the deepest fathoms of the sea, your team of daring brinepunk explorers is recruited to claim a massive deposit located beneath the ruins of an ancient civilization. However, your mission becomes a frantic battle for survival when the sunken kingdom\u2019s corrupted inhabitants rise against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One Action-Packed Battleground!</strong><br>Experience the adrenaline rush with the Abandoned Temple, the first region of the full game to experience <i>Abyssus</i>\u2019 nail-biting game flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Taste of Firepower!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engine Rifle \u2013 To start with a classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shotgun \u2013 Good job killing that Elite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turret \u2013 If you can beat the final challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revolver \u2013 Really? Where is it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Mods Galore!</strong><br>Primary fire, secondary fire... choose wisely if you want to survive in the Abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divine Power at Your Fingertips!</strong><br>All Gods are available - choose your patron, and fire at will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Tree Preview!</strong><br>Discover all the perks and power-ups available in the full game, and unlock the first two tiers to boost your playstyle in this Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize Your Look!</strong><br>Suit up with two badass suits, mix and match helmets, and tweak your colors for that perfect brinepunk style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you survive to see the surface again, or will the abyss claim your life?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/extras/Abyssus_PlayTheDemo_Steam_616x66.gif?t=1744293387\" /></p>","developers":["DoubleMoose Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1721110","name":"Abyssus"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437340/33ece4c783c48a3edc560882adecc1d5ad6380f6/header.jpg?t=1744293387","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 The Arcade Crew - Double Moose Games - 2025, all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124045,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124045/movie480.mp4?t=1744293305","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124045/movie_max.mp4?t=1744293305"},"name":"Deep Dive Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124045/2a094fe8920d0753ae24b071bb371b32c238c68c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744293305","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124045/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744293305","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124045/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744293305"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118683,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118683/movie480.mp4?t=1744293307","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118683/movie_max.mp4?t=1744293307"},"name":"Weapon Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/